{"id":18252,"name":"Grand Traverse County","slug":"grand-traverse-county","state":"Michigan","code":"MI","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/grand-traverse-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:50:32","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Deed Sale","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","deposit":"$1,000 credit card hold","extra":[{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Treasurer’s Office"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Tax-Sale.info"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Official County Website, MI"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"rT5KtOfv9wNtBbCEQT0gmEui6qd6wnxWYi3W54nOQ2DoGSFAz1Mvo7IzyDZaryIXYUF2xCklLJj9eN7sVkKjgpdcafh\"><iframe title=\"Find Your Bargain:Homes Reduced by 40-90% - Grand Traverse County - Michigan Tax Deed Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RZPnwVQb4xo?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Find-Your-Bargain:-Homes-Reduced-by-40-90%---Grand-Traverse-County---Michigan-Tax-Deed-Investing\">Home Prices Reduced by 40-90% in Grand Traverse County, MI</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Looking for a real estate bargain? Grand Traverse County, Michigan&#8217;s tax foreclosure auctions offer a chance to buy properties at 40 to 90% off. Here’s how you can get started:</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Overview-of-Grand-Traverse-County-Tax-Deed-Sales\">Overview of Grand Traverse Tax Deed Sales</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Grand Traverse offers tax deed sales through online auctions. These sales allow you to buy properties for a fraction of their market value​.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Auction-Details-and-Process\">Auction Details and Process</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Registration</strong>: Visit <a href=\"http://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax-Sale.info</mark></a> to register. A $1,000 credit card hold is required to participate. This is a deposit, not a charge, unless you win and fail to complete the purchase.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Bidding Phases in Grand Traverse County</strong>:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Advance Bidding</strong>: Starts 30 days before the auction. Place and modify your maximum bid without seeing others&#8217; bids.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Active Bidding</strong>: Begins at 10:00 AM on the auction day. You can see and adjust to the highest bids. You cannot make any changes after this phase starts.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Payment</strong>: If you win, you&#8217;ll receive an email with payment instructions. Complete your payment within five business days, including the bid amount, a 10% premium, the current year&#8217;s summer taxes, and a $30 deed fee. You can pay via wire transfer, certified check, or credit card (with a 2.75% processing fee).</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>No-Reserve Auctions</strong>: Unsold properties in Grand Traverse County may go to a no-reserve auction with bids starting at $100. Keep an eye on these opportunities for potential bargains.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Key-Details\">Key Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Traverse-City-Grand-Traverse-County-Michigan.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Traverse-City-Grand-Traverse-County-Michigan-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Traverse-City-Grand-Traverse-County-Michigan-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Traverse-City-Grand-Traverse-County-Michigan-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Traverse-City-Grand-Traverse-County-Michigan-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Traverse-City-Grand-Traverse-County-Michigan-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Traverse-City-Grand-Traverse-County-Michigan.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Traverse-City-Grand-Traverse-County-Michigan.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Traverse-City-Grand-Traverse-County-Michigan-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Traverse-City-Grand-Traverse-County-Michigan-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Traverse-City-Grand-Traverse-County-Michigan-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Traverse-City-Grand-Traverse-County-Michigan-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Traverse-City-Grand-Traverse-County-Michigan-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18261 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Traverse City, Grand Traverse County, Michigan\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">FAQs</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What is a tax deed sale?</strong> <br>A tax deed sale sells properties to recover delinquent property taxes. The buyer receives full ownership of the property.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What happens if I win a bid?</strong> <br>In <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Grand Traverse County</mark>, winners receive an email with instructions on completing the purchase. You must pay your bid, a 10% premium, current year&#8217;s summer taxes, and a $30 deed fee within five business days.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Can I back out after winning a bid?</strong> <br>No, once you win, you are obligated to complete the purchase.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>How can I learn more about upcoming auctions?</strong> Visit the <a href=\"http://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax-Sale.info</mark></a> site and <a href=\"https://www.gtcountymi.gov/650/Treasurer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Grand Traverse County Treasurer&#8217;s page</mark></a> for the latest information.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Links\">Important Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.gtcountymi.gov/1615/Properties-Available-For-Sale\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Properties for Sale</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.gtcountymi.gov/650/Treasurer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Treasurer</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.gtcountymi.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Grand Traverse County Official Website</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http://tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Auction Site</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Jump into the action and snag a property bargain at the next Grand Traverse County tax deed auction!</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-need-a-hand-nbsp\">Need a Hand?&nbsp;<a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/wayne-county/#h-need-a-hand\"></a></h4>\n\n\n\n<p>If you have questions or need guidance with tax lien investing, feel free to reach out. <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Book a call</mark></a><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\"> </mark>or access 